  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop brown onion and garlic.\n• Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Finely chop celery.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a2814a9ed0d3e2b5038bf0/step-6caf7f0d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large pot or saucepan, heat a good drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook onion, carrot and celery, stirring, until tender, 4-6 mins.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a2814a9ed0d3e2b5038bf0/step-a1c76404.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add diced tomatoes, risoni, garlic seasoning, vegetable stock powder, chilli flakes (if using) the water and the brown sugar.\n• Stir to combine, then bring to a boil.\n• Reduce heat to medium-high and simmer, stirring frequently, until risoni is 'al-dente', 12-20 mins.\n• Stir through the butter and spinach until wilted and season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a2814a9ed0d3e2b5038bf0/step-689d389f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide tomato & veggie risoni soup between bowls.\n• Top with grated Parmesan cheese.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a2814a9ed0d3e2b5038bf0/step-a321f1c8.jpg"
    }
  ]
